{"id":"cfebf3d79d57531c","group":"73","path":"73/73-thm-pratt-certificate-polynomial-size.md","title":"素性证书的多项式长度与可核验性","display":"thm-pratt-certificate-polynomial-size — 素性证书的多项式长度与可核验性","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-thm-pratt-certificate-polynomial-size","aliases":["73-thm-pratt-certificate-polynomial-size"],"display":"thm-pratt-certificate-polynomial-size — 素性证书的多项式长度与可核验性","depends_on":["[[73-thm-pratt-certificate-correctness]]","[[73-thm-modular-power-bit-complexity]]","[[73-df-binary-p]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§11.5.5, proof of Theorem 11.26, print pp. 520–521; PDF pp. 542–543; local certificate-size bound","source_status":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":11},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-thm-pratt-certificate-polynomial-size"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-thm-pratt-certificate-polynomial-size</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-pratt-certificate-polynomial-size — 素性证书的多项式长度与可核验性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d182dd0cac33ba74\" href=\"?note=d182dd0cac33ba74\" title=\"73-thm-pratt-certificate-correctness\">73-thm-pratt-certificate-correctness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"11ad5a1f324e7f83\" href=\"?note=11ad5a1f324e7f83\" title=\"73-thm-modular-power-bit-complexity\">73-thm-modular-power-bit-complexity</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5a23e63a72e2443c\" href=\"?note=5a23e63a72e2443c\" title=\"73-df-binary-p\">73-df-binary-p</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§11.5.5, proof of Theorem 11.26, print pp. 520–521; PDF pp. 542–543; local certificate-size bound"},{"key":"source_status","html":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"11"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge2}\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge2}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b=|\\operatorname{Bin}(n)|\">\\(b=|\\operatorname{Bin}(n)|\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PrattCode},\\operatorname{PairBits}\">\\(\\operatorname{PrattCode},\\operatorname{PairBits}\\)</span> 见已列依赖。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{PRATTV}\">\\(\\mathsf{PRATTV}\\)</span> 是下式的二进制验证语言。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists C\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge2}\\;\n\\bigl[\\operatorname{Prime}(n)\\Longrightarrow\\exists c\\in\\{d:\\operatorname{PrattCert}(d,n)\\}\\;\n|\\operatorname{PrattCode}(c)|\\le C(|\\operatorname{Bin}(n)|+1)^4\\bigr].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists C\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge2}\\;\n\\bigl[\\operatorname{Prime}(n)\\Longrightarrow\\exists c\\in\\{d:\\operatorname{PrattCert}(d,n)\\}\\;\n|\\operatorname{PrattCode}(c)|\\le C(|\\operatorname{Bin}(n)|+1)^4\\bigr].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{PRATTV}\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{PairBits}(\\operatorname{Bin}(n),\\operatorname{PrattCode}(c)):\nn\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge2},\\ c\\in\\{d:\\operatorname{PrattCert}(d,n)\\}\\},\\qquad \\mathsf{PRATTV}\\in\\mathsf P.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{PRATTV}\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{PairBits}(\\operatorname{Bin}(n),\\operatorname{PrattCode}(c)):\nn\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge2},\\ c\\in\\{d:\\operatorname{PrattCert}(d,n)\\}\\},\\qquad \\mathsf{PRATTV}\\in\\mathsf P.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>同一层所有节点标签的对数之和≤根标签的对数；除 3→2 及终止叶外，奇素数的任一孩子至多 (p−1)/2，所以树深 O(b)、每层节点数 O(b)，总节点数 O(b²)。每个节点的标签、见证及子数编码 O(b)，故宽松的 O(b⁴) 界成立。验证时先检查编码和整除乘积，再逐节点模幂，时间按整个证书长度计为多项式；失败或畸形输入拒绝。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-thm-pratt-certificate-correctness","status":"resolved","id":"d182dd0cac33ba74","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-thm-pratt-certificate-correctness]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-thm-modular-power-bit-complexity","status":"resolved","id":"11ad5a1f324e7f83","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-thm-modular-power-bit-complexity]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-binary-p","status":"resolved","id":"5a23e63a72e2443c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-binary-p]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge2}","display":false},{"tex":"b=|\\operatorname{Bin}(n)|","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PrattCode},\\operatorname{PairBits}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{PRATTV}","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists C\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge2}\\;\n\\bigl[\\operatorname{Prime}(n)\\Longrightarrow\\exists c\\in\\{d:\\operatorname{PrattCert}(d,n)\\}\\;\n|\\operatorname{PrattCode}(c)|\\le C(|\\operatorname{Bin}(n)|+1)^4\\bigr].","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{PRATTV}\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{PairBits}(\\operatorname{Bin}(n),\\operatorname{PrattCode}(c)):\nn\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge2},\\ c\\in\\{d:\\operatorname{PrattCert}(d,n)\\}\\},\\qquad \\mathsf{PRATTV}\\in\\mathsf P.","display":true}],"bytes":2001,"backlinks":[{"id":"34c08ba68aabce9a","anchor":"ref-28","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-thm-pratt-certificate-polynomial-size]]"},{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-319","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-thm-pratt-certificate-polynomial-size|素性证书的多项式长度与可核验性]] （本轮新建）"},{"id":"f7b3c70dde0fbf32","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["d182dd0cac33ba74","11ad5a1f324e7f83","5a23e63a72e2443c"]}